"I'm trying to upgrade my kernel from 2.2.16 to 2.4.2 but I'm
having problems with my serial ports. Basically, none of them seem to
work - and this includes my mouse on /dev/ttyS0 !

        What happens is that I get a message "LSR safety check engaged!".
I've had a glance at the source code to see if I can work out what it's
trying to do, but no joy.

        Has anyone else had this problem, or know how to solve it ?

Mike de G0WZY"

